repository-code: "https://github.com/rocacastro/secant-lie-groups-divided-differences"
url: "https://github.com/rocacastro/secant-lie-groups-divided-differences"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible numerical experiments for secant iterations on finite-dimensional
  Lie groups. The package includes reduced divided differences for SO(3)
  alignment and rotation averaging, a cached algorithmic secant and analytic
  Newton comparison for a Bessel field on SO(10), high-precision scalar
  validation on SO(2), exact rational checks, and reference data.
keywords:
  - Lie groups
  - secant method
  - divided differences
  - semilocal convergence
  - rank-one correction
  - rotation averaging
  - Bessel functions
  - reproducible research
license: MIT
